---
/**
 * AI駆動経営診断 v1.2（旧 DX診断 / 2026-05-03 改名）
 * 試作 03_デザイン・アセット/試作/diagnose_v1.html を Astro 化（2026-04-28）
 * Layout（SiteHeader / SiteFooter）を共有することで他ページと統一感を確保。
 *
 * 改名の経緯（2026-05-03）:
 *   旧「DX診断」をブランドコア「AI駆動経営」に揃えて改名。
 *   サブタイトルで「DX度＋AI駆動経営までの距離がわかる」を明示し、
 *   DXキーワード（SEO・経営者の入りやすさ）も維持。
 *   結果画面の「DX Lv ◯／AI駆動経営まで残り ◯段」は継続表示。
 *
 * 本実装の改良ポイント:
 *   - 試作の独自 nav を削除し、Layout の SiteHeader を使用
 *   - SiteFooter も自動で付く
 *   - スタイル・スクリプトはそのまま is:global / is:inline で持ち込み
 */
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import InlineIcon from "../../components/InlineIcon.astro";
---

<Layout
  title="AI駆動経営診断 — DX度＋AI駆動経営までの距離がわかる｜ツミキAI"
  description="10問・3分で自社のDX Lvと、AI駆動経営まで残り何段かがわかる無料診断。メール登録不要。"
>
  <main class="diagnose-page">
    <!-- ========== 画面1: イントロ ========== -->
    <div class="screen is-active" id="screen-intro">
      <section class="intro-hero">
        <div class="container">
          <span class="eyebrow">所要 3分 / 10問</span>
          <h1>
            DX → AI駆動経営、<br />
            <span class="accent">あと何段？</span>
          </h1>
          <p class="intro-lead">
            10問に答えるだけで、自社の <strong>DX Lv（現在地）</strong> と、<strong>AI駆動経営まで残り何段か</strong>がわかります。無料で、メール登録も不要です。
          </p>
          <button class="diag-btn diag-btn-accent diag-btn-lg" onclick="showScreen('quiz')">診断をはじめる</button>
          <div class="intro-meta">
            <span><span class="dot"></span>所要時間 約3分</span>
            <span><span class="dot"></span>登録不要</span>
            <span><span class="dot"></span>結果はその場で表示</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="intro-benefits">
        <div class="container">
          <div class="section-eyebrow">What you get</div>
          <h2>診断でわかる3つのこと</h2>
          <div class="benefits-grid">
            <div class="benefit-card">
              <div class="benefit-num">01</div>
              <h3>自社の DX Lv（現在地）</h3>
              <p>中小企業白書の4段階モデルで、自社がどのレベルにいるかを客観的に把握できます。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="benefit-card">
              <div class="benefit-num">02</div>
              <h3>AI駆動経営まで残り◯段</h3>
              <p>「❶❷ DX領域 → ❸❹ AI領域」の連続体上に、自社の位置と AI駆動経営までの距離を可視化します。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="benefit-card">
              <div class="benefit-num">03</div>
              <h3>今日からできる次の一手</h3>
              <p>レベル別に、小さく始められる具体的なアクションを提示。無理なく積み上げられます。</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- ========== 画面2: 設問 ========== -->
    <div class="screen" id="screen-quiz">
      <section class="quiz">
        <div class="progress-bar">
          <div class="container progress-inner">
            <span>AI駆動経営診断</span>
            <div class="progress-track">
              <div class="progress-fill" id="progress-fill"></div>
            </div>
            <span class="progress-count"><span id="progress-answered">0</span>/10</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="container" id="questions-container">
          <!-- JS で描画 -->
        </div>

        <div class="container">
          <div class="quiz-submit">
            <p class="quiz-submit-note" id="submit-note">すべての質問に答えると結果を表示できます</p>
            <button class="diag-btn diag-btn-accent diag-btn-lg" id="btn-submit" disabled onclick="submitQuiz()">結果を見る</button>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>

    <!-- ========== 画面3: 結果 ========== -->
    <div class="screen" id="screen-result">
      <section class="result">
        <div class="container">

          <!-- 結果ヒーロー -->
          <div class="result-hero">
            <div class="result-level-badge" id="result-level-badge">Lv —</div>
            <h1 id="result-headline">—</h1>
            <p class="result-state" id="result-state">—</p>
          </div>

          <!-- 4ステージマップ -->
          <div class="stage-map">
            <div class="stage-map-title">DX → AI駆動経営 の道のり</div>
            <div class="stage-map-sub">❶❷ DX領域 → ❸❹ AI領域 / あなたの現在地</div>
            <div class="stage-track">
              <div class="stage-line"></div>
              <div class="stage-nodes" id="stage-nodes">
                <!-- JS で描画 -->
              </div>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 最弱カテゴリ + 次の一手 -->
          <div class="result-grid">
            <div class="result-card">
              <div class="result-card-label">ここから着手</div>
              <h3 id="weakest-title">—</h3>
              <p id="weakest-desc">—</p>
            </div>
            <div class="result-card">
              <div class="result-card-label">今日からできる次の一手</div>
              <ul class="action-list" id="action-list">
                <!-- JS で描画 -->
              </ul>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 処方箋 -->
          <div class="prescription">
            <div class="prescription-head">
              <h2>ツミキAIの処方箋</h2>
              <p>3つの始め方（A.経営者が先に学ぶ／B.組織に入れる／C.一緒に実行する）で、あなたの現在地に最適な入口を提案します。</p>
              <p class="roadmap-hint">
                <span class="roadmap-hint-icon" aria-hidden="true"><InlineIcon name="lightbulb" size={18} /></span>
                <strong>どのLvでも、最初に <a href="/courses/roadmap/">ロードマップ講座（無料）</a> を読むと、4ステージ全体の地図が手に入ります。</strong>
              </p>
            </div>
            <div class="prescription-main" id="prescription-main">
              <!-- JS で描画 -->
            </div>
            <div class="prescription-sub" id="prescription-sub">
              <!-- 残り2ステージを控えめに表示 -->
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- 最終CTA -->
          <div class="final-cta">
            <h2>まずは話を聞いてみませんか？</h2>
            <p>千葉県印西市から、オンラインでも対面でも。無料相談は30分から。</p>
            <div style="display:flex;gap:12px;justify-content:center;flex-wrap:wrap;">
              <a class="diag-btn diag-btn-accent diag-btn-lg" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSd1yUsmc94ZTZ_MqR3tLVXDWlCaOmLIYxt3o2BqSb-AVF83gg/viewform" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">無料相談を予約する</a>
              <a class="diag-btn diag-btn-secondary diag-btn-lg" href="/#product-matrix">商品ラインナップを見る</a>
            </div>
          </div>

          <p class="retake">
            <a onclick="retake()">もう一度診断する</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style is:global>
  /* AI駆動経営診断ページ専用スタイル — diagnose-page スコープで他ページに影響しないようにする */
  .diagnose-page * { box-sizing: border-box; }

  .diagnose-page .container {
    max-width: 880px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }

  /* ---------- Buttons ---------- */
  .diagnose-page .diag-btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    gap: 8px;
    height: 44px;
    padding: 0 24px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md, 10px);
    font-family: var(--font-en, "Inter"), var(--font-jp, "Noto Sans JP");
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 15px;
    cursor: pointer;
    border: none;
    transition: transform 150ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), background 150ms ease, box-shadow 150ms ease;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .diagnose-page .diag-btn-accent {
    background: var(--color-accent, #FF6B35);
    color: #fff;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(26,58,95,0.08);
  }
  .diagnose-page .diag-btn-accent:hover {
    background: #E85C28;
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(26,58,95,0.08);
  }
  .diagnose-page .diag-btn-accent:disabled {
    background: #E5E7EB;
    color: #9CA3AF;
    cursor: not-allowed;
    transform: none;
    box-shadow: none;
  }
  .diagnose-page .diag-btn-secondary {
    background: #fff;
    color: var(--color-primary, #1A3A5F);
    border: 1px solid var(--color-primary, #1A3A5F);
  }
  .diagnose-page .diag-btn-secondary:hover {
    background: var(--color-bg-warm, #FAF7F2);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
  }
  .diagnose-page .diag-btn-lg { height: 52px; padding: 0 28px; font-size: 16px; }

  /* ---------- Screen 共通 ---------- */
  .diagnose-page .screen { display: none; }
  .diagnose-page .screen.is-active { display: block; }

  /* ---------- 画面1: イントロ ---------- */
  .diagnose-page .intro-hero {
    background:
      radial-gradient(1200px 500px at 110% -10%, rgba(255,107,53,0.08), transparent 60%),
      radial-gradient(900px 400px at -10% 110%, rgba(26,58,95,0.06), transparent 60%),
      var(--color-bg-warm, #FAF7F2);
    padding: 80px 0 72px;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .diagnose-page .intro-hero::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    pointer-events: none;
    opacity: 0.9;
    mix-blend-mode: multiply;
    background-image: url("data:image/svg+xml;utf8,<svg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' width='320' height='320' viewBox='0 0 320 320'><filter id='n'><feTurbulence type='fractalNoise' baseFrequency='0.65' numOctaves='3' stitchTiles='stitch'/><feColorMatrix values='0 0 0 0 0.35  0 0 0 0 0.22  0 0 0 0 0.12  0 0 0 0.22 0'/></filter><rect width='100%25' height='100%25' filter='url(%23n)'/></svg>");
    background-size: 320px 320px;
  }
  .diagnose-page .intro-hero > .container { position: relative; z-index: 1; }

  .diagnose-page .eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    background: var(--color-accent-soft, #FFE5D6);
    color: var(--color-accent-dark, #B84A1E);
    padding: 6px 14px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full, 999px);
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .diagnose-page .eyebrow::before {
    content: "";
    width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-accent, #FF6B35);
  }
  .diagnose-page .intro-hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-jp-serif, "Shippori Mincho");
    font-size: 44px;
    line-height: 1.45;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 24px;
    color: var(--color-text, #1A3A5F);
  }
  .diagnose-page .intro-hero h1 .accent { color: var(--color-accent, #FF6B35); }
  .diagnose-page .intro-lead {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.9;
    color: var(--color-text-body, #4B5563);
    margin: 0 auto 40px;
    max-width: 620px;
  }
  .diagnose-page .intro-meta {
    display: inline-flex;
    gap: 28px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-text-muted, #6C757D);
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 28px;
  }
  .diagnose-page .intro-meta span { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; }
  .diagnose-page .intro-meta .dot {
    width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--color-primary, #1A3A5F);
    opacity: 0.4;
  }

  .diagnose-page .intro-benefits {
    padding: 80px 0;
    background: #fff;
  }
  .diagnose-page .section-eyebrow {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 10px;
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent-dark, #B84A1E);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .diagnose-page .section-eyebrow::before {
    content: "";
    display: inline-block;
    width: 48px; height: 4px;
    background: var(--color-accent, #FF6B35);
    border-radius: 2px;
  }
  .diagnose-page .intro-benefits h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-jp-serif, "Shippori Mincho");
    font-size: 28px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 48px;
    color: var(--color-text, #1A3A5F);
  }
  .diagnose-page .benefits-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 20px;
  }
  .diagnose-page .benefit-card {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #E5E7EB);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 16px);
    padding: 28px 24px;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(26,58,95,0.08);
    transition: transform 200ms cubic-bezier(0.22, 1, 0.36, 1), box-shadow 200ms ease;
  }
  .diagnose-page .benefit-card:hover {
    transform: translateY(-2px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 24px rgba(26,58,95,0.10);
  }
  .diagnose-page .benefit-num {
    font-family: var(--font-en, "Inter");
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-accent, #FF6B35);
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .diagnose-page .benefit-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-jp, "Noto Sans JP");
    font-size: 18px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 12px 0;
    color: var(--color-text, #1A3A5F);
  }
  .diagnose-page .benefit-card p {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: var(--color-text-body, #4B5563);
    margin: 0;
  }

  /* ---------- 画面2: 設問 ---------- */
  .diagnose-page .quiz {
    padding: 48px 0 96px;
    background: var(--color-bg-warm, #FAF7F2);
    min-height: 80vh;
  }
  .diagnose-page .progress-bar {
    position: sticky;
    top: 72px;
    background: var(--color-bg-warm, #FAF7F2);
    padding: 16px 0;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border, #E5E7EB);
    margin-bottom: 32px;
    z-index: 5;
  }
  .diagnose-page .progress-inner {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 16px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-text-muted, #6C757D);
  }
  .diagnose-page .progress-track {
    flex: 1;
    height: 6px;
    background: var(--color-border, #E5E7EB);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full, 999px);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .diagnose-page .progress-fill {
    height: 100%;
    background: var(--color-accent, #FF6B35);
    border-radius: var(--radius-full, 999px);
    transition: width 300ms ease;
    width: 0%;
  }
  .diagnose-page .progress-count {
    font-family: var(--font-en, "Inter");
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--color-text, #1A3A5F);
    min-width: 48px;
    text-align: right;
  }

  .diagnose-page .cat-section { margin-bottom: 32px; }
  .diagnose-page .cat-label {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--color-primary, #1A3A5F);
    color: #fff;
    font-size: 12px;
    font-weight: 600;
    padding: 4px 12px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full, 999px);
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }
  .diagnose-page .question {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #E5E7EB);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 16px);
    padding: 28px;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(26,58,95,0.08);
    margin-bottom: 16px;
    transition: border-color 200ms ease, box-shadow 200ms ease;
  }
  .diagnose-page .question.is-answered { border-color: var(--color-accent-soft, #FFE5D6); }
  .diagnose-page .question-head {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .diagnose-page .question-num {
    flex-shrink: 0;
    font-family: var(--font-en, "Inter");
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-accent, #FF6B35);
    background: var(--color-accent-soft, #FFE5D6);
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full, 999px);
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
  }
  .diagnose-page .question-text {
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-text, #1A3A5F);
    line-height: 1.7;
    flex: 1;
  }
  .diagnose-page .answers {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .diagnose-page .answer-btn {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #E5E7EB);
    color: var(--color-text, #1A3A5F);
    padding: 14px 20px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-md, 10px);
    font-family: inherit;
    font-size: 15px;
    font-weight: 600;
    cursor: pointer;
    transition: all 150ms ease;
  }
  .diagnose-page .answer-btn:hover {
    border-color: var(--color-primary, #1A3A5F);
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(26,58,95,0.08);
  }
  .diagnose-page .answer-btn.is-selected {
    background: var(--color-primary, #1A3A5F);
    color: #fff;
    border-color: var(--color-primary, #1A3A5F);
  }
  .diagnose-page .answer-btn[data-answer="yes"].is-selected {
    background: var(--color-accent, #FF6B35);
    border-color: var(--color-accent, #FF6B35);
  }

  .diagnose-page .quiz-submit {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 48px;
    padding: 32px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #E5E7EB);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 16px);
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(26,58,95,0.08);
  }
  .diagnose-page .quiz-submit-note {
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--color-text-muted, #6C757D);
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }

  /* ---------- 画面3: 結果 ---------- */
  .diagnose-page .result { padding: 64px 0 96px; }
  .diagnose-page .result-hero {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 64px;
  }
  .diagnose-page .result-level-badge {
    display: inline-block;
    font-family: var(--font-en, "Inter");
    font-size: 14px;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--color-accent-dark, #B84A1E);
    background: var(--color-accent-soft, #FFE5D6);
    padding: 6px 16px;
    border-radius: var(--radius-full, 999px);
    letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .diagnose-page .result-hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-jp-serif, "Shippori Mincho");
    font-size: 36px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin: 0 0 20px 0;
    color: var(--color-text, #1A3A5F);
  }
  .diagnose-page .result-state {
    font-size: 17px;
    color: var(--color-text-body, #4B5563);
    line-height: 1.9;
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  /* ステージマップ */
  .diagnose-page .stage-map {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--color-border, #E5E7EB);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg, 16px);
    padding: 48px 40px 56px;
    box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(26,58,95,0.08);
    margin-bottom: 48px;
  }
  .diagnose-page .stage-map-title {
    text-align: center;
    font-family: var(--font-jp-serif, "Shippori Mincho");
    font-size: 20px;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .diagnose-page .stage-map-sub {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--color-text-muted, #6C757D);
    margin-bottom: 40px;
  }
  .diagnose-page .stage-track {
    position: relative;
    padding: 40px 0 20px;
  }
  .diagnose-page .stage-line {
    position: absolute;
    top: 56px;
    left: 0;
    right: 0;
    height: 4px;
    background: repeating-linear-gradient(to right, var(--color-border, #E5E7EB) 0 8px, transparent 8px 16px);
    border-radius: 2px;
    z-index: 0;
  }
  .diagnose-page .stage-nodes {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
  }
  .diagnose-page .stage-node {
    text-align: center;
    position: relative;
  }
  .diagnose-page .stage-node.zone-dx {
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(120,120,140,0.05) 0%, rgba(120,120,140,0.10) 100%);
    border-radius: 8px;
